     "**Generate Depth Values:** Create $N_s$ depth values $t_i$ uniformly distributed in the interval $[t_n, t_f]$.",
     "*   **Near/Far Equality:** If $t_n = t_f$, the interval is zero; samples collapse to the origin.",
     "*   **Zero Ray Direction:** If $\\mathbf{d} = \\mathbf{0}$, the ray has no direction.",
     "*   **Banding Artifacts:** If step size is too large, features are missed and a banding effect appears highlighting regions equidistant from the ray origin.",
     "Compute grid offsets as $0.5 \\cdot \\text{clamp\\_dist} \\cdot (\\text{arange}(N) + 1) / N$.",
     "Generate points at $z_{\\text{depth}} + \\text{grid}$."
    ]
